# Reusable pure typed functions with an immutable parameter.
define function square taking n as number to (n times n).
define function positive taking n as number to (n is greater than 0).
define function describe taking word as string to (uppercase of word).

let scores be a list of 2, 3, 4.
let squared be map every x in scores to (invoke square to x).
let high be filter every x in squared if (invoke positive to x).
assert first of squared is equal to 4.
assert last of squared is equal to 16.
print high.
print invoke describe to "semauri".
